menu "Project SNTP Configuration"

    config PROJ_SNTP_SERVER_PRIMARY
        string "Primary NTP server (optional)"
        default ""
        help
            Primary NTP server hostname or IP - e.g. your router's LAN IP
            if it provides NTP service. Leave blank to skip and use only
            the backup server below.

    config PROJ_SNTP_SERVER_BACKUP
        string "Backup NTP server"
        default "pool.ntp.org"
        help
            Used as a fallback if the primary server is unreachable, or as
            the sole server if PROJ_SNTP_SERVER_PRIMARY is left blank.

endmenu
